### 创建新订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "shippingAddress": "新的好货",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "1",
      "quantity": "1",
      "unitPrice": "233.00"
    },
    {
      "productId": "2",
      "quantity": "2",
      "unitPrice": "361.00"
    }
  ]
}

### 通过ID获取订单详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取用户所有订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取订单商品列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/12/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 更新订单状态
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/12/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "paid"
}

### 删除订单
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
